  "question": {
    "text": "<p>On complete reaction of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> with oxalic acid in aqueous solution containing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>KOH</mi></math>, resulted in the formation of product <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>. The secondary valency of Fe in the product A&nbsp;is ______ .</p><p>(Round off to the Nearest Integer).</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><munder><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>Fe</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder></math></p><p>Secondary valency of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi></math> in &#39;A&#39; is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
